{"data":[{"_id":"tool_file-importer","badge":{"label":"New","type":"new"},"category":"utility-tools","createdAt":"2025-10-05T11:36:16.050Z","description":"The Import Tool facilitates bringing external files into your Waysorted workspace, supporting a wide range of formats for design, data, and 3D assets. Select an importer type, upload your file, preview the import process, and manage fonts with automatic recommendations from Google Fonts or vectorization for compatibility. A credit system ensures efficient usage, with options to get more credits as needed. Ideal for migrating projects, incorporating client assets, or enhancing workflows with real-time previews and error-free imports.","disabled":false,"icon":"Import tool.svg","isActive":true,"name":"File Importer","shortDescription":"Upload and convert files like EPS, PSD, AI, JSON, CSV, FBX, or PowerPoint into editable design elements. Includes font installation suggestions, vectorization options, and credit-based processing for smooth integration.","slides":[],"slug":"file-importer","tags":["import","file-conversion","design-integration","productivity","asset-management"],"updatedAt":"2025-10-10T17:51:22.885Z","version":"1.0.0","iconData":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","benefits":["Supports diverse file types for versatile imports","Handles fonts intelligently to avoid compatibility issues","Real-time previews ensure accurate results before finalizing","Credit system manages usage efficiently","Speeds up workflow by eliminating manual conversions"],"features":["Multiple importers: EPS, PSD, AI, JSON, CSV, FBX, PowerPoint","File upload with size display and progress tracking","Preview pane for import status","Font management: Detect required fonts, suggest Google Fonts downloads, or vectorize for non-editable text","Credit balance display and \"Get Credits\" integration","Favorites and All Importers tabs for quick access","Options like \"Use Another\" file or \"Import Now\""],"howToUse":["Select an importer (e.g., EPS Importer)","Upload your file","Review preview and font suggestions","Enable vectorize if needed","Click Import Now (uses credits)"],"tagline":"Seamlessly import files from various formats into your designs with smart font handling and previews.","targetUsers":["Designers","Asset Migrators","Data Integrators","3D Modelers","Project Collaborators"],"hasSlides":false,"slideCount":0,"aiOverlay":null,"isAI":false,"heading":"Seamless Asset Importing Made Easy"},{"_id":"tool_frames-to-pdf","badge":{"label":"New","type":"new"},"category":"utility-tools","createdAt":"2025-10-05T11:36:15.986Z","description":"The PDF Exporter tool streamlines your sharing process by converting designs into clean, professional PDFs. Maintain vector quality, choose page layouts, and even customize export settings to match client needs. Ideal for designers, product managers, and teams needing fast turnarounds with consistent output.","disabled":false,"icon":"Frames to PDF.svg","isActive":true,"name":"Frames to PDF","shortDescription":"Export your Figma frames into high-quality PDFs without losing formatting. Perfect for presentations, reports, or quick sharing with clients.","slides":[],"slug":"frames-to-pdf","tags":["export","file-sharing","productivity"],"updatedAt":"2025-10-10T17:51:22.839Z","version":"1.0.0","iconData":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","benefits":["Saves time (no third-party apps needed)","Keeps formatting intact","Professional presentation-ready output"],"features":["Export entire projects or selected frames","Maintain vector quality & text formatting","One-click multi-page export","Customizable layouts (portrait/landscape)","Lightweight and quick"],"howToUse":["Select frames","Click Export","Customize settings","Download PDF"],"tagline":"Turn your designs into share-ready PDFs in seconds.","targetUsers":["Designers","Product Managers","Client Presentations","Documentation"],"hasSlides":true,"slideCount":8,"aiOverlay":null,"isAI":false,"heading":"High-Quality PDF Exports Made Easy"},{"_id":"tool_palettable-accessibility","badge":{"label":"New","type":"new"},"category":"accessibility-tools","createdAt":"2025-10-05T12:15:28.822Z","description":"The Paletteable tool empowers designers to build and refine color schemes effortlessly. Start with a selected color, explore variations such as darkening, desaturating, or analogous sets, and fine-tune with sliders for steps and intensity. Integrated accessibility features check contrast ratios against WCAG standards, APca metrics, and more, helping create compliant designs. Perfect for rapid prototyping, team collaborations, and professional outputs that prioritize usability and inclusivity.","disabled":false,"icon":"Palletable.svg","iconData":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","isActive":true,"name":"Palettable","shortDescription":"Generate customizable color palettes from a base color, apply variations like brightening or hue shifts, and evaluate accessibility compliance. Ideal for UI/UX design, branding, or ensuring inclusive visuals.","slides":[],"slug":"palettable","tags":["color-tools","design","accessibility","productivity","ui-ux"],"updatedAt":"2025-10-10T17:51:22.767Z","version":"1.0.0","benefits":["Speeds up palette creation with instant variations","Ensures designs meet accessibility standards (WCAG, APca)","Reduces errors in color contrast for better user experience","No need for external tools—integrated and efficient","Promotes inclusive design practices"],"features":["Select base colors via hex code or picker","Apply variations: Brighten, Darken, Desaturate, Hue, Analogous, Monochromatic","Adjustable sliders for steps (1-12 counts) and parameters like brightness (-100% to 100%)","Real-time palette previews and exports","Accessibility checks: Contrast ratio, WCAG/AAA compliance, blindness simulations, component evaluations","Support for multiple color combinations (e.g., base + secondary like white)"],"howToUse":["Select a base color (e.g., via hex input)","Choose a variation type (e.g., Brighten)","Adjust sliders for steps and intensity","Review accessibility checks","Export the palette"],"tagline":"Create dynamic color palettes with variations and accessibility checks in moments.","targetUsers":["UI/UX Designers","Brand Managers","Web Developers","Accessibility Specialists","Prototyping and Presentations"],"hasSlides":true,"slideCount":5,"aiOverlay":null,"isAI":false,"heading":"Accessible Color Palettes, Made Simple"},{"_id":"tool_unit-converter","badge":{"label":"New","type":"new"},"category":"utility-tools","createdAt":"2025-10-05T11:36:16.126Z","description":"The Unit Conversion tool simplifies resizing and unit switching in your designs, ensuring accuracy for various outputs. Input dimensions in one unit, convert to another (e.g., millimeters to pixels), set DPI for resolution, and incorporate bleed areas for professional printing. Choose from presets like banners or brochures, or save custom ones. Orientation options allow quick flips between portrait and landscape. Suited for designers handling print-ready files, mockups, or scalable assets with precise control over formatting.","disabled":false,"icon":"Unit Convertor.svg","isActive":true,"name":"Unit Converter","shortDescription":"Transform measurements across units like MM to PX, adjust DPI, add bleed margins, and use built-in presets for banners, cards, and more. Great for preparing designs for print or digital export.","slides":[],"slug":"unit-converter","tags":["design-tools","unit-conversion","print-preparation","productivity","export"],"updatedAt":"2025-10-10T17:51:23.002Z","version":"1.0.0","iconData":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","benefits":["Accurate conversions prevent sizing errors in designs","Quick presets for common formats save setup time","Integrated bleed and DPI for print-ready results","Customizable and savable for repeated workflows","Streamlines preparation without manual calculations"],"features":["Unit switching (e.g., MM, PX) with real-time conversion","DPI adjustment for resolution control","Add bleed margins with individual top/bottom/left/right settings","Preset library (Your Presets, All Presets, Favorites) including Banner, V-Card, Standee, Bi-fold, Brochure","Orientation toggle (portrait/landscape)","Export as Frame and Save As Preset options"],"howToUse":["Select units (e.g., MM) and DPI","Enter length/width dimensions","Enable/add bleed if needed","Choose a preset or orientation","Export as Frame or save preset"],"tagline":"Effortlessly convert design dimensions between units and apply presets for perfect sizing.","targetUsers":["Graphic Designers","Print Specialists","UI/UX Prototypers","Marketing Teams","Mockup Creation"],"hasSlides":true,"slideCount":7,"aiOverlay":null,"isAI":false,"heading":"Convert Dimensions Without Guesswork"},{"_id":"tool_comment-summarizer","badge":{"label":"Coming Soon","type":"up next"},"category":"way-ai-suite","createdAt":"2025-10-05T11:36:16.092Z","description":"Automatically summarize design comments and feedback using AI to help teams quickly understand key points and action items.","disabled":true,"icon":"AI lock.svg","isActive":false,"name":"Comment Summarizer","shortDescription":"AI-powered tool to summarize comments and feedback with ease.","slides":[],"slug":"comment-summarizer","tags":["ai","summarize","comments","collaboration"],"updatedAt":"2025-10-10T17:51:22.936Z","version":"0.0.0","iconData":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","tagline":"Summarize comments and feedback with AI-powered intelligence.","hasSlides":false,"slideCount":0,"aiOverlay":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","isAI":true,"heading":""},{"_id":"tool_filter-and-effects","badge":{"label":"Unlock Soon","type":"unlock soon"},"category":"design-tools","createdAt":"2025-10-05T11:36:16.160Z","description":"Transform your designs with professional-grade filters and effects. Apply adjustments, enhancements, and creative effects to elevate your visual content.","disabled":true,"icon":"Lock SVG.svg","isActive":false,"name":"Filter & effects","shortDescription":"Apply filters and effects to your designs with ease and precision.","slides":[],"slug":"filter-and-effects","tags":["filters","effects","design","enhancement"],"updatedAt":"2025-10-10T17:51:23.046Z","version":"0.0.0","iconData":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","tagline":"Apply professional filters and effects to enhance your designs.","hasSlides":false,"slideCount":0,"aiOverlay":null,"isAI":false,"heading":""},{"_id":"tool_font-pairer","badge":{"label":"Unlock Soon","type":"unlock soon"},"category":"way-ai-suite","createdAt":"2025-10-05T11:36:16.198Z","description":"Find harmonious font pairings effortlessly with intelligent suggestions. Create professional typography combinations that enhance your designs.","disabled":true,"icon":"Lock SVG.svg","isActive":false,"name":"Font Pairer","shortDescription":"AI-powered font pairing tool for creating perfect typography combinations.","slides":[],"slug":"font-pairer","tags":["fonts","typography","pairing","ai","design"],"updatedAt":"2025-10-10T17:51:23.086Z","version":"0.0.0","iconData":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","tagline":"Discover perfect font combinations with AI-powered pairing suggestions.","hasSlides":false,"slideCount":0,"aiOverlay":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","isAI":true,"heading":""}]}